  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p class=\"p1\"><strong>• About our brand and products:</strong></p><p class=\"p1\">Muscle D Fitness designs and manufactures commercial-grade gym equipment for facilities and home gyms. With 47 years of innovation, we offer selectorized machines, plate-loaded equipment, free weights, cardio machines, and complete fitness solutions.</p><p class=\"p1\"><strong>• What makes us different:</strong></p><p class=\"p1\">Fast shipping, exclusive product lines not available elsewhere, superior value with high quality at competitive prices, and turnkey solutions for any facility type. We're self-funded with no debt and focus on making fitness accessible to everyone.</p><p class=\"p1\"><strong>• How affiliates can earn:</strong></p><p class=\"p1\">5% commission on entire order value (excluding shipping, assembly and tax). Commissions paid on all completed sales generated through your unique affiliate link.</p><p class=\"p1\"><strong>• How to promote us:</strong></p><p class=\"p1\">Share our equipment on social media, create content about commercial gym setups and home gym setups, review our products, target gym owners and fitness enthusiasts. Use our product images, installation photos, and customer success stories in your promotions.</p><p class=\"p1\"><strong>• Other information:</strong></p><p class=\"p1\">Average order value is $4,500. We serve both commercial facilities and home gym customers. Our top-selling lines include Excel Leverage, cardio equipment, and Megatron systems. Professional assembly services available for most orders.</p></div></div>",
